  "reason": "The claim states that the description for PHAR 6403 is missing, but the page explicitly states that 'Three elective rotations can be selected in areas such as pediatrics, drug information, infectious diseases, ICU/critical care, emergency medicine, advanced hospital practice, managed care, psychiatry, geriatrics, hospice, nutrition, pharmacokinetics, or any other approved healthcare area.' This general description applies to all APPE Elective courses, including PHAR 6403. The finding incorrectly assumes that each elective course should have an individual description, when the catalog provides a collective description for all elective APPE rotations. Therefore, the claim is a false positive."
